      "paths": [
        "crates/horizon-client-core/src/lang.rs",
        "crates/horizon-client-render/src/packs.rs"
      ],
      "finding": "read_lang_file is now public with the same body. Pack Merge::Lang still takes strict object JSON first; otherwise it uses the native lenient language reader and collects strings. A # comment layer is newly retained and overlaid. This does not make all malformed bytes valid.",
      "impact": "Old strict-pack/direct-lenient distinction is historical 624c only. Latest fixture needs a lenient-comment case and must preserve strict object versus lenient scalar-conversion behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": "mod-overlay",
      "paths": [
        "crates/horizon-client/src/mod_content.rs"
      ],
      "finding": "build and Overlay::write are unchanged in the full diff. Mod language files still replace the lower resulting file as a whole. resource_root now uses one stamp-prefix directory per content set, touches the stamp on a hit, and prunes other stale roots after a build. live_switch admits asset/data-only content while rejecting registry/world-generation changes.",
      "impact": "Selected-pack fix does not repair Mod whole-file key loss. Old cache placement/stamp proposal needs a separate latest-aware design; direct build fixtures do not prove resource_root, pruning or Game activation."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-reload",
      "paths": [
        "crates/horizon-client/src/game/mods.rs",
        "crates/horizon-client/src/game/options.rs",
        "crates/horizon-client/src/game/packs.rs",
        "crates/horizon-client/src/game/startup_menu.rs"
      ],
      "finding": "Game tracks selected versus applied/live content and feeds applied_mods into reload. Successful apply calls mods_reloaded for the supported local/integrated server path. load_language and selected-then-server startup ordering are unchanged in the reviewed diffs. New browsing/install UI and menu focus changes do not prove retained UI rerender.",
      "impact": "Native lifecycle owner is still authoritative. Do not duplicate CURRENT or infer remote-server/reload authority from a prepared language snapshot."
    },
    {
      "id": "motion-contact",
      "paths": [
        "crates/horizon-client/src/motion.rs",
        "crates/horizon-client/src/game/native_hooks.rs"
      ],
      "finding": "PlayerMotion adds on_climbable and climbable updates it; powder-snow fire processing is an event; EnterBlock now precedes the damage_only early continue. Selected native inside/step/fall/contact/consume functions are byte-equal to624c. Inside remains a static dispatch without a Game borrow.",
      "impact": "Existing motion query/order guards need repinning and real validation. No same-invocation mutable contact authority is established by this source audit."
    },
    {
      "id": "tank-acceptance",
      "paths": [
